# The AI speaker (Waveshare ESP32-S3-AUDIO-Board): the USB line is the console (USB-Serial-JTAG; GPIO 43/44
# are the camera's XCLK and PCLK here, never a UART); the eye is an OV sensor on the 24 pin plug (the
# kit's OV5640), its control channel on the shared I2C bus, port 0.
CONFIG_ESP_CONSOLE_USB_SERIAL_JTAG=y
CONFIG_GC2145_SUPPORT=n
CONFIG_OV3660_SUPPORT=y
CONFIG_OV5640_SUPPORT=y
CONFIG_SCCB_HARDWARE_I2C_PORT0=y
